<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 5,439 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 5,439 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,439 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,437 on Tuesday. Dealers said the central bank bought $0.48 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 23		  Oct 22</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,439		   5,437</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)   7.78		    7.03</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
